{"claims": [{"text": "что то печально. я строил автономию в SOCC - всегда теряется нить в кадом новом чате-- то есть это ненормально. Как будто все что я делал MW- это бутафория", "line": 3, "entities": ["SOCC"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "assert"}, {"text": "proof_path.write_text(json.dumps(proof, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2), encoding=\"utf-8\")", "line": 437, "entities": ["Proof"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "assert"}, {"text": "\"truth_boundary\": \"PASS means full configured duration. FAST_PASS means short proof only, not 30m.\",", "line": 504, "entities": ["Proof"], "intent": "status_pass", "polarity": "negate"}, {"text": "\"truth\": \"Validates MW119 long-run. FAST_PASS is accepted as short foreground proof but not a full 30m claim.\",", "line": 528, "entities": ["Proof"], "intent": "status_pass", "polarity": "negate"}, {"text": "> proof_path.write_text(json.dumps(proof, ensure_ascii=False, indent=2), encoding=\"utf-8\")", "line": 777, "entities": ["Proof"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "assert"}, {"text": "И это ломает саму идею SOCC.", "line": 939, "entities": ["SOCC"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "assert"}, {"text": "Это не “нормальная строгая цепочка”. Это гигантское облако упоминаний, прогонов, деклараций, побочных веток, proof-файлов и stale-состояний.", "line": 1182, "entities": ["Proof"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "negate"}, {"text": "Вот это уже более серьёзный кандидат, потому что есть именно proof-pass.", "line": 1218, "entities": ["Proof"], "intent": "status_pass", "polarity": "assert"}, {"text": "But SOCC does not yet have trusted route sovereignty.", "line": 1246, "entities": ["SOCC"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "negate"}, {"text": "Это не SOCC-автономия. Это генератор веток.", "line": 1378, "entities": ["SOCC"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "negate"}, {"text": "lines.append(\"This is not a new construction MW. This is a reconstructed map from `core/socc/reality_ledger/state/current_truth_reconstructed_v1.json`.\")", "line": 1519, "entities": ["SOCC"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "negate"}, {"text": "-bash: ENTITY_SUBSTRATE: command not found", "line": 1630, "entities": ["Entity Substrate"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "negate"}, {"text": "-bash: MEMORY_WAVE: command not found", "line": 1636, "entities": ["Memory Wave"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "negate"}, {"text": "MW105 → ANNA return gate, not build", "line": 2299, "entities": ["ANNA"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "negate"}, {"text": "\"missing_signals\": [\"clean class taxonomy\", \"birth authority\", \"ANNA as born entity not random folder\", \"entity lifecycle proof\"],", "line": 2695, "entities": ["ANNA", "Proof"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "negate"}, {"text": "\"question\": \"Why did SOCC autonomy not become a living self-building loop despite many PASS artifacts?\",", "line": 2822, "entities": ["SOCC"], "intent": "status_pass", "polarity": "negate"}, {"text": "\"Hermes/Codex not mandatory for all construction\",", "line": 2827, "entities": ["Hermes", "Codex"], "intent": "definition", "polarity": "negate"}, {"text": "\"Memory Wave not used as required selector input\",", "line": 2828, "entities": ["Memory Wave"], "intent": "requirement", "polarity": "negate"}, {"text": "lines.append(\"This is not a new construction MW. This is the taxonomy SOCC must read before any future construction.\")", "line": 2868, "entities": ["SOCC"], "intent": "requirement", "polarity": "negate"}, {"text": "mlines.append(\"│   └── must produce diff/proof/rollback\")", "line": 2972, "entities": ["Proof"], "intent": "requirement", "polarity": "assert"}], "dates": [{"value": "2026-04-29", "line": 514, "raw": "2026-04-29"}, {"value": "2026-04-29", "line": 1110, "raw": "Apr 29"}, {"value": "2026-04-29", "line": 1152, "raw": "2026-04-29"}, {"value": "2026-04-29", "line": 1153, "raw": "2026-04-29"}, {"value": "2026-04-29", "line": 1154, "raw": "2026-04-29"}, {"value": "2026-04